<section class="section alt"><div class="container grid-2"><div><p class="eyebrow">Process</p><h2>A guided path from first brief to finished launch.</h2><p class="lede">The workflow keeps strategy, content, design, assets, and implementation connected instead of scattering decisions across disconnected handoffs.</p></div><div class="process-list"><div class="process-item"><div><h3>Clarify the risk picture</h3><p>Review current coverage, life changes, business exposures, budget, and decision deadlines.</p></div></div><div class="process-item"><div><h3>Compare practical options</h3><p>Explain tradeoffs, exclusions, deductibles, and recommendations in language clients can use.</p></div></div><div class="process-item"><div><h3>Support the next review</h3><p>Document decisions, prepare renewal reminders, and keep the advisory path organized.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
